{"actions":[{"actionCode":null,"actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"Senate","text":"Received in the Senate and Read twice and referred to the Committee on Environment and Public Works.","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"H38310","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"Motion to reconsider laid on the table Agreed to without objection.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H37100","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"On passage Passed by the Yeas and Nays: 211 - 204 (Roll no. 360). (text of amendment in the nature of a substitute: CR H6050)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"8000","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Passed/agreed to in House: On passage Passed by the Yeas and Nays: 211 - 204 (Roll no. 360).","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H36210","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"On motion to recommit Failed by the Yeas and Nays: 204 - 213 (Roll no. 359).","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H30000","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H6070-6072)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H.R. 845, the Chair put the question on motion to recommit and by voice vote announced that the noes had prevailed. Mr. Huffman demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8A000","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"The previous question on the motion to recommit was ordered pursuant to clause 2(b) of rule XIX.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H36200","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"Mr. Huffman moved to recommit to the Committee on Natural Resources. (text: CR H6056)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H35000","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 845.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632 and H.R. 4371. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, under a structured rule and H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632, and H.R. 4371 under a closed rule. The resolution provides one motion to recommit on each bill.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H30000","actionDate":"2025-12-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 951. (consideration: CR H6049-6056)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H1L210","actionDate":"2025-12-16","source":"House floor actions","text":"Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 951 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632 and H.R. 4371. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, under a structured rule and H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632, and H.R. 4371 under a closed rule. The resolution provides one motion to recommit on each bill.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H12410","actionDate":"2025-10-03","source":"House floor actions","text":"Placed on the Union Calendar, Calendar No. 285.","type":"Calendars"},{"actionCode":"H12200","actionDate":"2025-10-03","source":"House floor actions","text":"Reported (Amended) by the Committee on Natural Resources. H. Rept. 119-332.","type":"Committee"},{"actionCode":"5000","actionDate":"2025-10-03","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Reported (Amended) by the Committee on Natural Resources. H. Rept. 119-332.","type":"Committee"},{"actionCode":"H19000","actionDate":"2025-04-09","source":"House committee actions","text"